    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Ancestral Steppes — Insects (Tier 6-10)</strong></p>\n<p>Amellwind field gathering node for <em>Ancestral Steppes</em> (Plains, Forests, Mountains), party levels <strong>6-10</strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Resource Node:</strong> Insects harvest DC <strong>13</strong>. Double-click the token to gather (Item Piles–style).</li>\n<li><strong>Hidden Detection:</strong> Passive Perception DC <strong>15</strong> (tier-scaled). Place the token <em>hidden</em>; proximity reveals it.</li>\n<li><strong>Loot pool:</strong> 6 stack(s) from the environment resource table (roll 1dN on success).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Requires Midi QOL + Item Macro modules. Resource Node hooks arm from the module script; Hidden Detection arms from the module script / Sync macro.</em></p>",
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": ""
